sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title YuPay — fulfilment routes through sourcing → inventory or supplier

    participant FE as Customer / Admin
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant INV as inventory
    participant SRC as sourcing
    participant SUP as Fulfiller (mock / steam / ...)

    Note over FE,SUP: 0. Admin seeds the warehouse (one-off)

    FE->>API: POST /admin/inventory/bulk-upload {sku_id, codes:[...]}
    API->>INV: bulk_upload(sku_id, codes, uploaded_by)
    INV->>DB: INSERT inventory_codes (encrypted) × N, dedup on (sku_id, code_hash)
    INV->>DB: INSERT inventory_uploads (total, succeeded, duplicates)
    API-->>FE: 200 BulkUploadOut

    Note over FE,SUP: 1. Customer pays → fulfilment kicks in

    FE->>API: POST /payments/intents → ...webhook(succeeded)
    API->>API: payments._mark_payment_succeeded → order.status=paid
    API->>API: fulfillment.start_for_order(order_id)

    loop per OrderItem
        API->>SRC: resolve_for_sku(item.sku_id)
        alt no row OR mode=auto
            SRC-->>API: Decision(primary=inventory, fallback=supplier:mock, strict=False)
        else mode=force_inventory
            SRC-->>API: Decision(primary=inventory, fallback=None, strict=True)
        else mode=force_supplier
            SRC-->>API: Decision(primary=supplier:<slug>, fallback=None, strict=True)
        end
        API->>DB: INSERT fulfillment_tasks(supplier=<route_label>)
    end

    Note over FE,SUP: 2. process_task per task

    loop per task
        alt task.supplier == 'inventory'
            API->>INV: reserve_and_issue(sku, order_item)
            alt success
                INV->>DB: UPDATE one inventory_codes SET state='issued' (FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED)
                INV-->>API: IssuedCode(code, inventory_code_id)
                API->>DB: INSERT deliveries(artifact={code, source:'inventory'})
                API->>DB: task.status='succeeded'
            else no stock + strict
                API->>DB: task.status='failed', last_error='no stock and sourcing rule is strict'
            else no stock + auto
                API->>SRC: resolve_for_sku again (read fallback)
                API->>DB: fulfillment_attempts(kind=fulfill, payload={route_switch:'mock'})
                API->>DB: task.supplier = 'mock'
                API->>SUP: fulfill(item, idempotency_key=task.id)
                SUP-->>API: FulfillResult(succeeded, artifact={code:'MOCK-...'})
                API->>DB: INSERT deliveries(artifact={code, source:'<slug>'})
                API->>DB: task.status='succeeded'
            end
        else supplier route
            API->>SUP: fulfill(item, idempotency_key=task.id)
            SUP-->>API: FulfillResult
            API->>DB: INSERT deliveries(artifact={code, source:'<slug>'})
        end
    end

    API->>API: _try_settle_order — all tasks succeeded → order.status=delivered
    API-->>FE: order tracking shows status=delivered + delivery artifact
